#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:10004
#: 814bd8f14adb4ea599951a048c004a01
msgid ""
"Gravitational-wave detectors record data in *digital counts* — raw ADC "
"output. Before any astrophysical analysis the data must be converted to "
"physical strain $h(f)$ or displacement $x(f)$ by applying a **calibration "
"transfer function**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:10008
#: 446ea5cf540745c28aad72e22f305b00
msgid "KAGRA's calibration pipeline involves two steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:10010
#: ad4d90ac3ce84d99acc3bb08edfd848a
msgid ""
"**Coupling factor measurement** — a known signal (swept or stepped sine) is "
"injected via the photon calibrator (PCal) and the detector response is "
"measured using `ResponseFunctionAnalysis`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:10013
#: c8fde7b6c6474897a27a5c94f591f88c
msgid ""
"**Calibration application** — the raw spectrum is divided by the coupling "
"function to produce a calibrated strain-equivalent ASD."
msgstr ""

