#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:40004
#: 4e39603286cc42869e1c1258b665d342
msgid ""
"We create a synthetic DARM (Differential Arm length) signal in counts. The "
"system has:"
msgstr "DARM（差動アーム長）信号をカウント単位でシミュレートします。 システムは以下のノイズ成分を持ちます："

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:40006
#: df647fa709014fdc8966f9b5631f84fa
msgid "**Optical cavity pole** at 50 Hz (single-pole low-pass response)"
msgstr "**光学キャビティポール** 50 Hz（単極低域通過特性）"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:40007
#: be12bd2f01f243b883bfdb679aee48d7
msgid "**Seismic wall** rising below 10 Hz as 1/f^4"
msgstr "**地震ノイズ** 10 Hz 以下で 1/f^4 で上昇"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:40008
#: 4cc7d21ec7684ac69a6806f08780bb25
msgid "**Shot noise** floor flat above ~100 Hz"
msgstr "**ショットノイズ** 100 Hz 以上でフラット"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:40009
#: 0aa3f5c1d7814bf79327dc40c56710fe
msgid "**Lines** at 60 Hz (power) and 120 Hz (harmonic)"
msgstr "**電源周波数干渉** 60 Hz および 120 Hz"

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:60002
#: e9f516c8c1fd41fdb9af98be2373644e
msgid "2. Stepped-Sine Injection Campaign"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:60004
#: 51bd3962677046ccb5deba4d4884a2de
msgid ""
"In a real calibration run, a PCal signal is injected at a series of discrete"
" frequencies while the detector is locked.  Each frequency step typically "
"lasts 30–120 s."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:60008
#: 9a0e949b7f8649639b838e57eb7b4418
msgid ""
"We synthesise an injection campaign with 6 frequencies spanning 10–1000 Hz."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:80002
#: 2f718dfe69ad4d2e81efa2662df15039
msgid "3. Extract Coupling Factors"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:80004
#: e40c75d24ac3451c98adc33244ebf865
msgid ""
"`ResponseFunctionAnalysis.compute()` automatically detects the injection "
"steps in the witness channel and estimates the coupling factor at each "
"injected frequency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:80008
#: 55cfe1f7ab4b4266b58637ccaf310c6d
msgid "The coupling factor $C(f_i)$ is defined as:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:80010
#: a009c7fcfce84c9f94b36bed115544a1
msgid ""
"C(f_i) = "
"\\frac{\\text{ASD}_{\\text{target}}(f_i)}{\\text{ASD}_{\\text{witness}}(f_i)}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:100002
#: fce7711c11ad4207b06f5b8f4dbcead4
msgid "4. Fit the Calibration Transfer Function"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:100004
#: 7b3b27ddc0bd40d1aebe4eca5c4830e0
msgid "We fit a single-pole model to the measured coupling factors:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:100006
#: 7921f44ee4ca458587e073bd17bbd035
msgid "C(f) = \\frac{C_0}{1 + i\\,f / f_\\text{pole}}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:100008
#: 31b6130e4c35447b9f852c286467b6a2
msgid "The fit gives us a smooth, continuous calibration function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:130002
#: 715da27ddb934f1994f0fa30f1dc47f9
msgid "5. Apply Calibration — Counts → Metres ASD"
msgstr ""

#: ../../how-to/case-studies/case_calibration_pipeline.ipynb:130004
#: fca2512784c4494cb5491aa7e45fa300
msgid ""
"With the calibration function in hand, we apply it to the raw DARM ASD to "
"produce a calibrated displacement ASD in metres per root-Hz."
msgstr ""

